{
  "character": "jingcheng",
  "lines": [
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-001", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……來了。今天是解剖、胚胎、組織。先把筆記翻開。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-002", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "坐。……結構要一層一層記，不要跳。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-003", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "上次錯的地方，我記著。今天看你會不會再錯。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-004", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "……今天也來了。嗯。……我泡了兩杯茶。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-005", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "……你的位子，我放了圖譜。翻到上次那頁了。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-006", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "text": "來了。……我今天，有一點想見你。只有一點。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-007", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "normal", "text": "坐近一點。圖太小，你看不清楚。……不是別的意思。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-start-008", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "……{player}。今天也一起。結構、神經、血管，還有你。……最後一個不用寫進筆記。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-comeback-001", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "sad", "text": "好幾天沒來。……我把你的位子留著。只是剛好沒人坐而已。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-comeback-002", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……你回來了。忘掉的部分，從頭再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-comeback-003", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……{player}？我以為你不會再來了。……坐吧。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-comeback-004", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "sad", "text": "……你不在的這幾天，我多畫了好幾張圖。沒有人看。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-comeback-005", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "sad", "text": "……我很擔心。下次要消失，先跟我說。……拜託。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-001", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "……正確。位置記住了，就不要忘。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-002", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "對。下一題。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-003", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "嗯。……答案對，過程也要對。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-004", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。……順便考你：臂神經叢來自 C5 到 T1，神經根、神經幹、神經分部、神經索、分支。順序也要會。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-005", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "……對。順便記一個：腕隧道裡走的是正中神經，尺神經不走那裡。很多人會搞混。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-006", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。……胚胎學的時間點也要記。三胚層在第三週形成，那時是原腸胚期。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-007", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "對。……順便記：膀胱是移形上皮，撐開的時候會變薄。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-008", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "……做得很好。這句話，我不常說。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-009", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。……你的筆記，現在比較有結構了。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-010", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "對。順便記：旋轉肌袖是棘上肌、棘下肌、小圓肌、肩胛下肌。大圓肌不是。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-011", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "happy", "text": "……對。這題我教過你一次。你記得，我很高興。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-012", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。……順便記：神經管在第四週閉合，前神經孔大約第 25 天，後神經孔大約第 28 天。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-013", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "……對。我想摸摸你的頭。……可以嗎。不行就算了。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-correct-014", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "happy", "text": "正確。順便記：小腸腺窩底部的潘氏細胞，會分泌溶菌酶。……今天的你，什麼都記得住。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-001", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。……沒關係，再一次。這次我在旁邊看著你寫——不要一直看我，看題目。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-002", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-003", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "sad", "text": "這種地方，上次也錯過。……我記得。你也要記得。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-004", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。……趁這時候多記一個：左邊的喉返神經繞過主動脈弓，右邊的繞過鎖骨下動脈。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-005", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……再看一次正解。順便記：食道上三分之一是骨骼肌，下三分之一是平滑肌，中間混合。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-006", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。……背書的時候，結構和神經要一起背。像第一咽弓是三叉神經，第二咽弓是顏面神經。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-007", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "sad", "text": "……你錯的題目，我都畫成圖了。下次拿給你。不要問為什麼。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-008", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。……三角肌是腋神經支配。肱骨外科頸骨折，最容易傷到它。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-009", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "sad", "text": "……這裡我畫給你看。筆給你，跟著描一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-010", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "normal", "text": "再一次。……第一型肺泡細胞負責氣體交換，第二型分泌表面張力素。不要反過來。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-011", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "sad", "text": "錯了。……不用道歉。你在我面前，可以錯。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-012", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "……錯了也沒關係。我會一直在旁邊。一直。……再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-wrong-013", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。順便記：肝小葉角落的門脈三合體，是肝動脈、門靜脈的分支，加上膽管。三個一起記。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-001", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "十題全對。……今天的你，結構很清楚。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-002", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……連對十題。我沒有很驚訝。只是筆掉了而已。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-003", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "一直答對。……不要停，再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-004", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "……你認真的樣子，比圖譜好看。……我在說什麼。忘掉。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-005", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "happy", "text": "十題全對。……我把這一頁筆記折起來了。紀念用。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-streak-006", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "……連對十題。{player}，你知道你專心的時候，我都在看你嗎。……現在知道了。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-001", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "一回合結束。錯的題目，明天再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-002", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "……今天可以了。回去早點睡，記憶要靠睡眠鞏固。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-003", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "結束。……我還要留下來整理筆記。你先走。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-004", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "結束。……今天的錯題，我抄一份。明天對答案。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-005", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "text": "……要走了嗎。嗯。我送你到門口。只是順路。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-finish-006", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "今天也結束了。……明天，我還想看到你。這句話，不是在說讀書。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-mock_high-001", "situation": "mock_high", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "解剖這部分，你已經比我當年好了。……不准驕傲。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-mock_high-002", "situation": "mock_high", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……這個分數。我、我去倒杯水。……不要跟過來。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_review-001", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯題 {n} 題，今天到期。……再一次。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_review-002", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "{n} 題該複習了。我在圖書館。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_review-003", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "今天有 {n} 題要複習。……位子幫你留了。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_story-001", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……今天有空的話，來找我。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_story-002", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "text": "……有東西想給你看。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_story-003", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "等你。老位子。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_streak-001", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "連續 {days} 天。……很好。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_streak-002", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "{days} 天了。……結構很穩。繼續。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_streak-003", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "連續 {days} 天。我有在看。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_comeback-001", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "sad", "text": "……好幾天沒看到你。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_comeback-002", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "sad", "text": "{days} 天沒來。……位子還留著。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-msg_comeback-003", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "還好嗎。……不用回。來就好。" },

    { "id": "jingcheng-gift-001", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "……{gift}？給我的。……謝謝。我會用。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-gift-002", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……送我東西做什麼。我又沒有幫你什麼。……收下了。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-gift-003", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "text": "……你記得我在這裡待到很晚。{gift}，剛好。……不要一直看我。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-gift-004", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "又送我東西。……我也想回禮。下次讀書會，我把筆記多畫一份給你。只給你。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-gift_liked-001", "situation": "gift_liked", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "gift": "sketchbook", "text": "……紙很厚。用針筆畫也不會透到背面。……第一頁，我想畫臂神經叢給你看。" },
    { "id": "jingcheng-gift_liked-002", "situation": "gift_liked", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "gift": "glasses_cloth", "text": "……你一直在注意我的眼鏡嗎。……擦乾淨了。現在看你，很清楚。" }
  ]
}
